                "- Convert subsections to a numeric scheme like 1.1, 1.2, 2.1, 2.2.\n"
                "- Ensure consistent casing and concise phrasing.\n"
                "- Keep meaning but improve clarity.\n"
                "- Output only the cleaned list, one heading per line.\n\n"
